                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0z0jmwh16b4w731afnsf91wibia5].[Multiple Values]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>Note 1 about the &quot;GP Per GMV Lost Ratio&quot;: </run>
                <run italic='true'><![CDATA[It is used to measure the trade-off between GP and GMV when we "increase" Prices. Think of this metric as the price increase "efficiency." It is "typically" < 1 and is only calculated when the GMV change is ]]></run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>-ve. </run>
                <run italic='true'>Otherwise, it&apos;s NULL</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>Note 2 about the &quot;GMV Per GP Lost Ratio&quot;: </run>
                <run italic='true'>It</run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>is used to quantify the trade-off between GMV and GP when we &quot;decrease&quot; prices and is only calculated when the GP change is </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>-ve</run>
                <run italic='true'>. Otherwise, it&apos;s NULL</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ff0000' italic='true'>Both </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' italic='true'>&quot;GP Per GMV Lost&quot; </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ff0000' italic='true'>and </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' italic='true'>&quot;GMV Per GP Lost&quot;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ff0000' italic='true'> ratios are good metrics for </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' italic='true'>relative comparisons among variants</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>Note 3</run>
                <run italic='true'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>about the DF/Revenue/Profit Fields: </run>
                <run italic='true'>There might be minor deviations between this dashboard and the </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>DPS AB test dashboard</run>
                <run italic='true'> due to the </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>source of the DF</run>
                <run italic='true'>. This dashboard uses the actual DF paid from </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>pd_orders </run>
                <run italic='true'>and accounts for </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>all types of incentives </run>
                <run italic='true'>that could be applied to an order. The </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>DPS AB test dashboard </run>
                <run italic='true'>uses delivery_fee_local from the </run>
                <run bold='true' italic='true'>cDWH</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='true' />
                <format attr='size' value='1.9890055656433105' />
              </style-rule>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minwidth' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxwidth' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
